SUMMARY:Jenny Bradley's Curated Fourth Tuesdays
DESCRIPTION:ft: Elizabeth McCorvey\, Stevie Tombstone\, Molly Rose Reed and A. Lee Edwards! \nCome and hear what Asheville has been talking about… Curated Fourth Tuesdays hosted by Jenny Bradley. Always at The River Arts District Brewing Company (across from the Grey Eagle). This incredible group of artists will each perform a half hour set of their original music with a few choice fresh covers peppered in. Jenny adds some harmony. Some collabs spontaneously occur! It’s always fun\, friendly and purely good vibes. Food truck on site. Line up: Stevie Tombstone\, Elizabeth McCorvey\, A Lee Edwards and Molly Rose Reed! Suggested $10 at the door. Pay more if you can\, pay less if you need to. Everyone welcome!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jenny-bradleys-curated-fourth-tuesdays/
LOCATION:River Arts District Brewing\, 13 Mystery St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
